# jot's WebLLM worker fetches the models from Hugging Face with no Referer (D26):
# huggingface.co refuses a cross-origin request from a *.workers.dev page (the
# branch Previews) that sends both an Origin and a Referer. A worker takes its
# referrer policy from its own script's response.
/assets/webllm-*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
